## 6. Key Concepts

### Replication
Maintaining copies of database records across multiple database servers.

### Sharding
Distributing data across multiple database nodes to support scalability.

### Availability
Ensuring that database services remain accessible when failures occur.

### Consistency
Ensuring that database copies and transactions follow defined data consistency rules.

### Cloud and Container Deployment
Using containerised database services to demonstrate deployment and management.

